256
00:17:18.710 --> 00:17:21.940
Sellise niivõrd.

257
00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:25.070
Suure maadleja isiksuse.

258
00:17:26.869 --> 00:17:29.680
Elu, aga ma arvan, et

259
00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:30.960
